Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:08:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): open installed example projects from the File menu

Add the example submenu to the File ribbon Open list.
Use the existing guarded project-open command.
Pin visibility, filtering, ordering, loading, and unsaved changes.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2043
